  "caption": "Most people see Granada in the wrong order. Which spot would you go back to? 👇\n\nTwo days that beat the crowds: the Nasrid Palaces only at the time on your ticket, so book early, and El Bañuelo free on Sundays before San Nicolás at sunset.\n\nUrban Tales plans your trip in a minute and tells you the story of every stop as you walk.\n.\n.\n.\n#granada #alhambra #spaintravel #traveltips #urbantales",
